# Backend Java

- Root package `com.mystaria.phantasmon_backend`. Packages by domain (`auth`, `pokemon`, `trade`, `battle`, `presence`, `websocket`, `version`, `admin`, `common`).
- Flyway only; never `ddl-auto: update`; never edit an applied migration. Schema: `Documentation/PHANTASMON_DB_SCHEMA.md`.
- `PokemonLegalityService` on create/patch/import. Idempotency on sensitive POSTs.
- `PlayerPresence` in memory, not SQL. Testcontainers PostgreSQL, never H2. Test before production code.
